    },
    {
      "id": "H03",
      "description": "East replica and south journal fail; west journal and north fence are healthy."
    },
    {
      "id": "H04",
      "description": "The restore API error reflects a transient UI cache only and does not indicate a local failure."
    },
    {
      "id": "H05",
      "description": "Three independent faults coexist: east snapshot replay schema is too old, north leader is behind its required commit index, and west WAL reserve is below its minimum."
    }
